      "en": "So Joshua did as Moses had told him, and fought with Amalek; and Moses, Aaron, and Hur went up to the top of the hill.",
      "ko": "여호수아가 모세의 말대로 행하여 아말렉과 싸우고 모세와 아론과 훌은 산꼭대기에 올라가서",
      "source_text_hash": "0812731ff2e5d5bc23a8ceb4053c80f5318063289488a53b1b485416a60c469c",
      "translation_text_hash": "e59c0c7e2bc3049d625ba92c8be427ff262265e2e9e80e4546d7d20008ea2188",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
