      "en": "When Moses held up his hand, Israel prevailed. When he let down his hand, Amalek prevailed.",
      "ko": "모세가 손을 들면 이스라엘이 이기고 손을 내리면 아말렉이 이기더니",
      "source_text_hash": "048ee25d8613a6f769a430ffb03ea1c0edb571d3d17f825f914bf93374003f67",
      "translation_text_hash": "8d17d8add475be88d351b996a1ccb8d8b21d1fedbf23a7e1d3361a60db5b9dde",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
